  <description>
    Simple collaborative robot (cobot) model for the MIRACLE digital twin.
    Features base, shoulder, elbow, and wrist revolute joints with
    cylindrical links. Designed for machine tending and part handling
    tasks alongside CNC machines.
  </description>
